# asked of that ability, which is Terrasymbiosis's whichever card is on top. On turn 5 Bot1's first Snakeskin Veil puts a
# +1/+1 counter on the merged creature and Bot1 draws a card; the second Veil's counter that turn does not trigger it -
# nothing goes on the stack.

